0..72 Comment "// This source shows a theory whose port names a type of its own source."
73..75 Comment "//"
76..151 Comment "// A port sort that no sort of the theory declares names a type member. The"
152..226 Comment "// scope of the source that declares the theory resolves it. A source that"
227..298 Comment "// uses the theory reads the same member, whatever its own scope binds."
299..301 Comment "//"
